{
  "id": "WorldStoryScaleScrollFull",
  "slug": "world-story-scale-scroll-full",
  "title": "The Doom Scroll That Made His Legs Taller Than a Skyscraper",
  "fps": 30,
  "voice_provider": "kokoro",
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "voice_speed": 0.84,
  "voice_pause_seconds": 0.16,
  "kokoro_dictionary_only": true,
  "kokoro_pronunciations": {
    "Wi": "wa\u026a",
    "Fi": "fa\u026a",
    "cm": "s\u02c8\u025bnt\u026ami\u02d0t\u025az"
  },
  "script": [
    {
      "beat": "Rule",
      "text": "In this town, the more you doom scroll, the longer your legs get."
    },
    {
      "beat": "Measurement",
      "text": "If you scroll 10 cm on your phone, your legs grow by exactly 10 cm.",
      "voice_speed": 1.1
    },
    {
      "beat": "No limit",
      "text": "And there's no limit.",
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.45
    },
    {
      "beat": "Classroom",
      "text": "One student secretly scrolls during class."
    },
    {
      "beat": "Ceiling gag",
      "text": "By lunchtime, his knees are touching the ceiling."
    },
    {
      "beat": "Bedroom gag",
      "text": "Another man scrolls so much before bed that his feet stick out his bedroom window.",
      "voice_speed": 1.0
    },
    {
      "beat": "Basketball",
      "text": "Even basketball players use this to their advantage.",
      "voice_speed": 1.1
    },
    {
      "beat": "Practice",
      "text": "They spend hours scrolling before every game."
    },
    {
      "beat": "Payoff",
      "text": "One player is now so tall that he doesn't even need to jump."
    },
    {
      "beat": "Scale reveal",
      "text": "And the biggest doom scroller in our town, his legs are taller than a skyscraper.",
      "voice_speed": 1.1
    },
    {
      "beat": "Button",
      "text": "The government installed a Wi Fi router on his head so he could keep scrolling.",
      "voice_speed": 1.1
    },
    {
      "beat": "Resolve",
      "text": "I've always tried to avoid doom scrolling.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.4
    },
    {
      "beat": "Night",
      "text": "But last night, I was lying in bed thinking,",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.5
    },
    {
      "beat": "Temptation",
      "text": "Just one more video.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.5
    },
    {
      "beat": "Repeat",
      "text": "Then another one.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.4
    },
    {
      "beat": "Repeat",
      "text": "And another one.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.4
    },
    {
      "beat": "Viewer",
      "text": "And you're probably lying in bed right now thinking the exact same thing.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.3
    },
    {
      "beat": "Time jump",
      "text": "Three hours later, I finally put my phone down.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.4
    },
    {
      "beat": "Wake",
      "text": "But when I tried to get out of bed, my legs were 12 meters long!",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.4
    },
    {
      "beat": "Exterior",
      "text": "I couldn't even fit inside my own house!",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.45
    },
    {
      "beat": "Mother",
      "text": "My mom opened the window and shouted,",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.45
    },
    {
      "beat": "Reprimand",
      "text": "I told you to go to sleep!",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.6
    },
    {
      "beat": "Journey",
      "text": "Getting to school was surprisingly easy.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.4
    },
    {
      "beat": "Scale problem",
      "text": "I only needed six steps, but sitting inside the classroom was impossible.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75
    },
    {
      "beat": "Search",
      "text": "So I started looking for a solution.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.45
    },
    {
      "beat": "Discovery",
      "text": "And then I discovered something incredible.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.5
    },
    {
      "beat": "Reverse rule",
      "text": "Scrolling in the opposite direction makes your legs shorter.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.55
    },
    {
      "beat": "Experiment",
      "text": "I immediately started scrolling backward.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "beat": "Freeze",
      "text": "My legs were shrinking, but suddenly my phone froze.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.68
    },
    {
      "beat": "Runaway",
      "text": "Then it started scrolling backward by itself.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.65
    },
    {
      "beat": "Panic",
      "text": "Stop! Stop! Stop!",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "beat": "Minimum",
      "text": "By the time I turned it off, my legs were only two centimeters long.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.45
    },
    {
      "beat": "Rescue",
      "text": "My little brother had to carry me home in his backpack.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.65
    },
    {
      "beat": "Realization",
      "text": "But then I realized something.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.45
    },
    {
      "beat": "Mastery",
      "text": "I could use doom scrolling to become any height I wanted.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.4
    },
    {
      "beat": "Shelf",
      "text": "Need to reach the top shelf? One swipe!",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.2
    },
    {
      "beat": "Tower",
      "text": "Need to climb a building? A hundred swipes!",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.45
    },
    {
      "beat": "Control",
      "text": "I finally found a way to control my height.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.2
    },
    {
      "beat": "Curiosity",
      "text": "But there's something I'm curious about.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.38
    },
    {
      "beat": "Question",
      "text": "How far have you scrolled today?",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.15
    },
    {
      "beat": "Scale ladder",
      "text": "10 meters? A hundred meters? Maybe even a kilometer?",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.38
    },
    {
      "beat": "Viewer rule",
      "text": "Imagine if this rule existed in your world.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.15
    },
    {
      "beat": "Look down",
      "text": "Actually, don't look down.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.14
    },
    {
      "beat": "Last reveal",
      "text": "Your legs might already be growing.",
      "voice_speed": 1.03,
      "voice_duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0
    }
  ],
